  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The depth, scale, massing, and design of the proposed development&amp;nbsp;would be overbearing and incongruous addition&amp;nbsp;to the host&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;dweliinghouse&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_GB&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;lrru28dwvwfxgyl5m&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;dwellinghouse&lt;/span&gt;, failing to be subordinate or harmonise with the scale and proportions of the host&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;dwellinghouse&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_GB&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;lrru28dvtcz6jurys&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;dwellinghouse&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and the terrace. The proposal would have a negative impact on the character of the wider area including&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;scayt-misspell-word&quot; data-scayt-word=&quot;Becontree&quot; data-wsc-lang=&quot;en_GB&quot; data-wsc-id=&quot;lrru28i3uqowqb74n&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Becontree&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Estate.&amp;nbsp;The proposed development&amp;nbsp;is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paragraphs 131, 135, 195, 200, and 209&amp;nbsp;of the National Planning Policy Framework (December&amp;nbsp;2023)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;D4 and HC1&amp;nbsp;of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;CP2 and CP3&amp;nbsp;of the&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Core Strategy (July 2010)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Policies&amp;nbsp;BP2&amp;nbsp;and BP11&amp;nbsp;of the&amp;nbsp;Local Development Framework (LDF) Borough Wide Development Plan Document (DPD) (March 2011)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Strategic Policy SP 2 as well as Policies DMD 1, DMD 4,&amp;nbsp;and DMD 6 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Draft Local Plan 2037&amp;nbsp;(Regulation 19 Submission Version, December 2021)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"
  ],
